# Keep captures and credentials out of the build context entirely.
#
# Not just a build-speed measure: anything copied into an image is recoverable
# from that image's layers even if a later step deletes it. `traces/raw/` holds
# unscanned model transcripts and `.env` holds a real token, so neither should
# ever enter the context in the first place.

.env
.env.local
*.token
mcp_server/mcp.json

# Unscanned captures. Promoted traces under traces/<name>/ have passed the
# secret gate and are fine; traces/raw/ has not.
traces/raw/
evidence/raw/

.git/
.github/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.DS_Store
.eval-runs/
bad_target/
mock_findings/
mock_pass/
scratch/

# Docs are not needed to run the suite, and excluding them keeps a docs-only
# edit from invalidating the layer cache.
*.md
!README.md
docs/
